    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Abrupt Valley, a competitive 1v1 city building/auto battler game. Create your city, upgrade your buildings, prepare you army and watch it fight your enemies. Optimize your city, adapt to your opponent and climb the ladder !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/3b2f6ecfefc02e1b5100382ac6117e18.avif?t=1691974524\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your City</h2>Build the best city to defeat your enemy. Gather gold and resources to build and upgrade military buildings. Adapt to your territory and optimize building placements.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/9aa89be15e64d11179e40db900058edd.poster.avif?t=1691974524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/9aa89be15e64d11179e40db900058edd.webm?t=1691974524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create You Army</h2>Create your army from the military units of your city. Choose the best units adapt your army to your enemy's troops. Grow your army and upgrade your units to become stronger.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/3fea9106f338c54e3bad497be570bbc4.poster.avif?t=1691974524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/3fea9106f338c54e3bad497be570bbc4.webm?t=1691974524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight For the Throne</h2>Fight against opponents all around the world or train against an AI to learn the game. Become the best player and climb the ladder. Become the true king of the Abrupt Valley.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/03318b10229c2087aa912cf7f5d43b45.poster.avif?t=1691974524\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138820/extras/03318b10229c2087aa912cf7f5d43b45.webm?t=1691974524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
